== Configuration ==

=== Environment variables ===

{| class="wikitable"
! Variable !! Default !! Purpose
|-
| <code>PROXY_LISTEN_PORT</code> || <code>9100</code> || WebSocket port that charge points connect to
|-
| <code>PROXY_DATA_DIR</code> || <code>/opt/charger/data</code> || Directory for the SQLite database
